  "description": "<p>The Fedora installer generated web.xml drops all attributes from the web-app element exception version and id, e.g.<br/>\n&lt;web-app id=\"WebApp_ID\" version=\"2.4\"&gt;<br/>\neven though the original web.xml (fcrepo-server/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/web.xml) reads:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;web-app id=\"WebApp_ID\" version=\"2.4\"<br/>\n  xmlns=\"http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"<br/>\n  xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee <a href=\"http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee/web-app_2_4.xsd\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/j2ee/web-app_2_4.xsd</a>\"&gt;</p>",
